|-------------|---------|---------|
| **📋 + [ ]** | Plan mode with workflow | `📋 1000xdev [rules-workflow]` |
| **💻 + [ ]** | Dev mode with workflow | `💻 1000xdev [front-end-workflow]` |
| **⚡ + [ ]** | Direct mode with workflow | `⚡ 1000xdev [back-end-workflow]` |
| **[ + -]** | Workflow with kebab-case | `[front-end-workflow]` |
